03", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_774312788169636_8407136546126498352_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yTzkJ_3AlSQQ7kNvwGPUFu8&_nc_oc=AdoPhevkclwyby0Xl80hAGTIwlhrgJb5bZX8QRQp-GzclOIiLphUuzqdHZSm2uNWmKk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-kGHl9PXW2UdP8Xd-35XwD0mhNKxXEXa1oAZMdbANdug&oe=6A450AA6"}]}, "id": "1377969980485338", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SC26.png", "id": "964420118677466", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031510_964420125344132_7279037948266946186_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eh_00Qv7zE4Q7kNvwGgshyL&_nc_oc=AdoGZjxrxXJ44u8Z7TUo8iqf1GkMAoD1S7VRe476ceCpqNKDFoOmD8osEDECR0VWWRU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-tam_Tl5O3D6d-difrb3wY_ByGC110gNzg2s74LLUxBA&oe=6A4515C5"}, {"file_name": "SC19.png", "id": "1028550412168366", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031459_1028550415501699_7667063941983084531_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gwRnF6Ba2koQ7kNvwGpf39c&_nc_oc=Adr7etqUt3twBO40kACV4To57gCWT_besyBxcBiRdbGLCJxcA8cRJyf3nXw--neyfjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9ZOPhnCXdeCXqxz3uI23gPLi0wXRXpBcVncc3fYBc6Eg&oe=6A45136C"}, {"file_name": "SC6.png", "id": "1213008986735069", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982453_1213008990068402_721949442093583782_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5f50MHoOWxQQ7kNvwG5UpP_&_nc_oc=AdrIyMByPPLqXIW4TNgLPIcwDEaz5aLJB2OxN716Z1iFGmSxZnLgVWthv1dFay6QfU8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8RleTFtx2UCt4dgwMxRTaEmCAhXZtlS8OrkmozSeMxMg&oe=6A452720"}, {"file_name": "SC25.png", "id": "2182709462063835", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_2182709465397168_1136481695964559917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EAW-dEhGfRcQ7kNvwHVT9NS&_nc_oc=AdqIyBCtAsisORwljvVE-rBd5GKMDFkIRiv9dBCmh5Y8N2EeZjFO5MA2ncfEfao2Kew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9M17hNbPcYbhu4VfaZJMSni6S3PZYb0g8QfS7cxGSUzw&oe=6A451C36"}, {"file_name": "SC11.png", "id": "1020526033014243", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250452_1020526036347576_3573329723363051043_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LoZs9WFESS8Q7kNvwFVgE0P&_nc_oc=AdoGoUYUCNtC-JpztzmkCgoyJSKY7HLgAq_1mpzpSiWVkQ57O6fv98EXDP4wrVPJcjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-1Id3St2aZgwvuqAZkYAQ3oYEM33DP0tLU2f6UIOT8tg&oe=6A4511AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCover.png", "id": "1670277503511368", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974650_1670277506844701_2413630122857125207_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YT1yDObBeY8Q7kNvwFGdJpm&_nc_oc=AdrK2TGvXoAeMT3dPao3hKYuOxWEJ0foNr51H9heDbyTF3REomT2tpYybqDNa3geYsk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-srzH3-elMUTSdoyas4aT-22tnjcQXR-wUXkNyymPmpw&oe=6A452255"}, "display_name": "Venture's Gauntlet: Ultimate VR Fitness", "keywords": ["fitness", "adventure", "obstacle", "story", "platformer"], "long_description": "# VR's Ultimate Action-Platformer\n\nObsessed with his family's legacy, aging billionaire Adam Venture is looking for a capable heir to the Venture name and fortune. His only requirement? The skill and tenacity to overcome a series of deadly obstacle courses known as: **Venture\u2019s Gauntlet**\n\n{960204795511693}\n\n# Comfortable Locomotion \n\nRun, climb, swing and zipline your way through the gauntlet in comfort and style with **TrueMotionVR** arm swing controls.\n\n\n# Overcome Dangerous Challenges\n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive.\n\n{472666925095689}\n\n# Embark On An Epic Journey\n\nTraverse giant cliffs, delve into the depths of the earth and climb crumbling castles across 9 intense stages inspired by the Highlands of Scotland.\n\n{2173852816328585}\n\n# Breathtaking Visuals\n\nExperience beautiful graphics powered by Unreal Engine. A dynamic time of day and weather system makes the world feel alive as you progress through the Gauntlet.\n\n{408266168650091}\n\n# Uncover the secrets of the Ventures\n\nThe ever-present Adam Venture watches your every move. Do you have the skill to impress him, or will you be a disappointment like all the others?\n\n{1446632349279537}\n\n# Tailor Made Courses\n\nCalibration adjusts the Gauntlet\u2019s obstacles to your height & arm length measurements to ensure the best experience for all users.\n\n# Claim the ultimate glory\n\nCompete against other players for the best times on each stage on the online leaderboards.\n\nSo ask yourself this -  do **YOU** have what it takes to run the Gauntlet?\n\nWe think you can do it!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Venture\u2019s Gauntlet is an intense parkour & obstacle course game that features arm swing movement, climbing, archery, moving lasers, shooter drones, shields, and more.  \n\nPlaying the game is an immersive physical experience, a test of both fitness and skill because you are the one running, climbing, and dodging through challenging courses!  \n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive and claim Adam Venture's fortune.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "BearHammer Games Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id"